\paragraph{Runtime overhead.}
\label{sec:runtime}
Full S1 adds $+$2.3\% on SciERC and $+$5.4\% on DocRED (same GPU); under fine-tuning, overhead drops to $+$2.3\% (61\,ms/doc).
